{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001065","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001065"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001065","label":"孫武","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"孫武","mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0037","c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0012"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0037","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p027","quote":"孫武"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p028","quote":"孫武"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"孫武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001065","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"孫武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001065","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji031-011","person_id":"cbr-p001065","title":"將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p027","quote":"將軍孫武曰："}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji031-011:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p027","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"將軍","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0037","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"來源授予、自立與用稱分開；日期只錄原表述，不以死亡自動終止官爵。夫槩自立與闔廬爭位分存，不選唯一合法王號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p027","text":"三年，吳王闔廬與子胥、伯嚭將兵伐楚，拔舒，殺吳亡將二公子。光謀欲入郢，將軍孫武曰：「民勞，未可，待之。」四年，伐楚，取六與灊。五年，伐越，敗之。六年，楚使子常囊瓦伐吳。迎而撃之，大敗楚軍於豫章，取楚之居巣而還。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000423","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"伯嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001064","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0022","start":22,"end":28,"surface":"吳亡將二公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代；有虞等不直接補作熟知個人，仍待覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"孫武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001065","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m027-0077","start":77,"end":81,"surface":"子常囊瓦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001066","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-031","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p028","text":"九年，吳王闔廬請伍子胥、孫武曰：「始子之言郢未可入，今果如何？」二子對曰：「楚將子常貪，而唐、蔡皆怨之。王必欲大伐，必得唐、蔡乃可。」闔廬從之，悉興師，與唐、蔡西伐楚，至於漢水。楚亦發兵拒吳，夾水陳。吳王闔廬弟夫槩欲戰，闔廬弗許。夫槩曰：「王已屬臣兵，兵以利爲上，尚何待焉？」遂以其部五千人襲冒楚，楚兵大敗，走。於是吳王遂縱兵追之。比至郢，五戰，楚五敗。楚昭王亡出郢，奔鄖。鄖公弟欲弑昭王，昭王與鄖公犇隨。而吳兵遂入郢。子胥、伯嚭鞭平王之屍以報父讎。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0008","start":